stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Idle
    Idle --> LoadingProfile: Load profile
    LoadingProfile --> ProfileLoaded: Success
    LoadingProfile --> LoadError: Fetch failed
    LoadError --> LoadingProfile: Retry

    ProfileLoaded --> ViewMode: Display profile
    ViewMode --> EditMode: Click edit
    EditMode --> ViewMode: Cancel

    EditMode --> ValidatingFields: Input changes
    ValidatingFields --> EditMode: Validation complete

    EditMode --> PreviewMode: Click preview
    PreviewMode --> EditMode: Back to edit

    EditMode --> Publishing: Save changes
    Publishing --> PublishSuccess: Event published
    Publishing --> PublishError: Publish failed
    PublishSuccess --> ViewMode: Update display
    PublishError --> EditMode: Show error

    ViewMode --> VerifyingNIP05: Check NIP-05
    VerifyingNIP05 --> ViewMode: Verification complete

    ViewMode --> [*]: Unmount
